WEBVTT

00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:06.169
Open Commerce, Point of sale, Registers.

00:00:06.169 --> 00:00:10.723
Each register shows whether it is on, the address of its store, and

00:00:10.723 --> 00:00:13.280
links to its Shifts and to Edit it.

00:00:13.807 --> 00:00:15.177
Click Add register.

00:00:15.177 --> 00:00:18.847
Give it a Name that staff see when they pick a register, such

00:00:18.847 --> 00:00:23.887
as Uptown till 1, and choose its Store location, the place whose stock its sales take.

00:00:25.297 --> 00:00:27.211
Enter the Store address:

00:00:27.211 --> 00:00:31.805
the street, the city, the region, the postal code and the country.

00:00:31.805 --> 00:00:36.910
Sales at the register are taxed by this address, and its receipts show it.

00:00:36.910 --> 00:00:39.527
The country is its two-letter code.

00:00:40.016 --> 00:00:43.249
Enter the Currency its drawer holds, such as U.S.D.

00:00:43.249 --> 00:00:46.596
Leave it blank to sell in the products' own currency.

00:00:47.094 --> 00:00:51.952
Under Who may sell here, tick the roles whose staff may use this register.

00:00:51.952 --> 00:00:56.446
With none ticked, anyone with the Sell at a register permission can.

00:00:56.446 --> 00:01:00.636
The On switch turns the register off, so it cannot open a shift

00:01:00.636 --> 00:01:02.094
or ring up a sale.

00:01:02.589 --> 00:01:03.561
Click Save.

00:01:03.561 --> 00:01:07.452
The register is added, and staff who may sell there can open a

00:01:07.452 --> 00:01:09.169
shift from the till app.

